# a map's own member stays the word beside an entry of its name, as Rust's reads_entry_first: prelude_words.warp's
# symbol_words keeps the words in a map and returns found.keys, which the word `keys` of runtime/ordering.warp turned
# into the entry yes (card self-hello)
found = {}
found["keys"] = yes
found["a"] = yes
print(found.keys)
